  "summaryEn": "Musk reacts in real time inside mission control as SpaceX's first Falcon Heavy lifts off, filmed for the Nat Geo series MARS.",
  "summaryZh": "SpaceX首枚猎鹰重型火箭升空时，马斯克在任务控制中心内作出实时反应；画面为国家地理系列节目《火星》拍摄。",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BL4dnvBytLA",
