  "contentKind": "dialogue",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "p-0001",
      "speakerEn": "Speaker A",
      "startSec": 1.44,
      "textEn": "That thing took off. Oh, my God.",
      "textZh": "那东西升空了。哦，我的天。",
      "speakerZh": "说话人A"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0002",
      "speakerEn": "Speaker A",
      "startSec": 12.48,
      "textEn": "All systems currently green.",
      "textZh": "目前所有系统均正常。",
      "speakerZh": "说话人A"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0003",
      "speakerEn": "Speaker A",
      "startSec": 16.72,
      "textEn": "Falcon Heavy is configured for flight A minus 15. Standby for terminal count. All right, guys, final 10.",
      "textZh": "猎鹰重型火箭已配置为飞行A减15。等待最终倒计时。好了，各位，最后10。",
      "speakerZh": "说话人A"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0004",
      "speakerEn": "Speaker A",
      "startSec": 44.14,
      "textEn": "Oh, my God.",
      "textZh": "哦，我的天。",
      "speakerZh": "说话人A"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0005",
      "speakerEn": "Speaker A",
      "startSec": 55.9,
      "textEn": "You see them both? Light up inside. Shut down inside boosters.",
      "textZh": "你看到它们两个了吗？在内部点火。关闭内部助推器。",
      "speakerZh": "说话人A"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0006",
      "speakerEn": "Speaker A",
      "startSec": 69.88,
      "textEn": "Look at that.",
      "textZh": "看看那个。",
      "speakerZh": "说话人A"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0007",
      "speakerEn": "Speaker A",
      "startSec": 72.28,
      "textEn": "That's unreal.",
      "textZh": "太不真实了。",
      "speakerZh": "说话人A"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0008",
      "speakerEn": "Speaker A",
      "startSec": 80.04,
      "textEn": "And the falcons have landed. Wow. Lz1, lz2. Both side boosters have touchdown.",
      "textZh": "猎鹰已经着陆。哇。Lz1，lz2。两枚侧助推器都已着地。",
      "speakerZh": "说话人A"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-0009",
      "speakerEn": "Speaker A",
      "startSec": 93.24,
      "textEn": "Coming up very short. This.",
      "textZh": "差得非常远。这个。",
      "speakerZh": "说话人A"
    }
  ],
